{"strongs": "H1433", "word": "גֹּ֫דֶל", "translit": "go.del", "root": "גדה", "morph": "H:N-M", "pos": "noun masculine", "gloss": "greatness", "definition": "גֹּ֫דֶל noun masculine greatness — Deut 32:3 + 5 t.; suffix גָּדְלוֺ Deut 5:21 + 5 t.; גֻּדְלוֺ Ps 150:2 — 1. greatness, magnitude , tree Ezek 31:7 , arm of God Ps 79:11 גְּדֹל Exod 15:16 , mercy of God Num 14:19 . 2. magnificence , \\ \\ a. king Ezek 31:2 ; Ezek 31:18 \\ \\ b. God Deut 3:24 ; Deut 5:21 ; Deut 9:26 ; Deut 11:2 ; Deut 32:3 ; Ps 150:2 . 3. in a bad sense, גֹּדֶל לֵבָב = pride, insolence of heart Isa 9:8 ; Isa 10:12 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1496')\">BDB1496</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H1433')\">H1433</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1495')\">BDB1495</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1497')\">BDB1497</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>גֹּ֫דֶל</bdbheb> <b>noun masculine</b> <highlightword>greatness</highlightword> — <ref ref=\"Deut 32:3\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(5,32,3)\">Deut 32:3</ref> + 5 t.; suffix <bdbheb>גָּדְלוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 5:21\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(5,5,21)\">Deut 5:21</ref> + 5 t.; <bdbheb>גֻּדְלוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 150:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"150\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"150\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,150,2)\">Ps 150:2</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>greatness, magnitude</highlight>, tree <ref ref=\"Ezek 31:7\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"7\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"7\" onclick=\"bcv(26,31,7)\">Ezek 31:7</ref>, arm of God <ref ref=\"Ps 79:11\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"79\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"79\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(19,79,11)\">Ps 79:11</ref> <bdbheb>גְּדֹל</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 15:16\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(2,15,16)\">Exod 15:16</ref>, mercy of God <ref ref=\"Num 14:19\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"14\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"14\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(4,14,19)\">Num 14:19</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>magnificence</highlight>, <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> king <ref ref=\"Ezek 31:2\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(26,31,2)\">Ezek 31:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ezek 31:18\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(26,31,18)\">Ezek 31:18</ref> <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> God <ref ref=\"Deut 3:24\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(5,3,24)\">Deut 3:24</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 5:21\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(5,5,21)\">Deut 5:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 9:26\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(5,9,26)\">Deut 9:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 11:2\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(5,11,2)\">Deut 11:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Deut 32:3\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"32\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"32\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(5,32,3)\">Deut 32:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 150:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"150\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"150\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,150,2)\">Ps 150:2</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> in a bad sense, <bdbheb>גֹּדֶל לֵבָב</bdbheb> = <highlight>pride, insolence of heart</highlight> <ref ref=\"Isa 9:8\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(23,9,8)\">Isa 9:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 10:12\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(23,10,12)\">Isa 10:12</ref>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Deut 32:3", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 32, "verse": 3}, {"raw": "Deut 5:21", "book": "DEU", "chapter": 5, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "Ps 150:2", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 150, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Ezek 31:7", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 31, "verse": 7}, {"raw": "Ps 79:11", "book": "PSA", "chapter": 79, "verse": 11}, {"raw": "Exod 15:16", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 15, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Num 14:19", "book": "N